================================================================================
## Normalize simulation fact predicates for SWRL
================================================================================

Context: Cust360Auto’s fact wizard supplies ontology predicates such as
``...#hascontract``, while R2RML-loaded triples use the data namespace
``.../hascontract``. A hypothetical contract attached to Jacob Martin
therefore did not join the SWRL rule, although customers with mapped live
relationships did.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/simulation/SimulationRunner.py
   Resolve known ontology predicates to their R2RML data-namespace aliases
   before applying sandbox patches.
2. tests/units/simulation/test_simulation_runner_api.py
   Cover an ontology ``#`` predicate becoming the sandbox ``/`` predicate.
3. docs/user-guide.md
   Document predicate resolution for hypothetical facts.

